# Every media and build product under promo/ is local-only. Directory names are
# written without a slash so they match at any depth (a pattern like
# `composition/assets/` would anchor here and miss `intro/composition/assets/`).
out/
renders/
render/
assets/
node_modules/
*.log

# This repository tracks no binary media, stills included. Everything below is a
# build output: MP4s are published on YouTube (see the Demo section of the
# README), poster frames are regenerated alongside them, and the music bed is
# synthesized on demand by intro/capture/lib/bgm.mjs.
*.mp4
*.webm
*.mov
*.mp3
*.m4a
*.aac
*.wav
*.flac
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif